Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.33,0:00:21.00,Default,@int_Tojo,0,0,0,,It sank... at that speed?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.55,0:00:25.71,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,The speed is...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.71,0:00:28.09,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,No, the pressure is so intense.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.08,0:01:00.87,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,But two runs...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:01.75,0:01:04.79,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,Those will be hard to get back.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.76,0:01:16.60,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a white ball flying across the snow?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:17.56,0:01:23.77,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a demon of a man who has sold his soul to baseball?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:26.11,0:01:30.36,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,We didn't come from Hokkaido to enjoy baseball.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:37.29,0:01:39.83,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,We came to take the championship banner.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:42.42,0:01:44.42,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,And that's what we'll do!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.75,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Strike three! You're out!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:49.46,0:01:53.93,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,As if you big-city pansies could ever stop us.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:55.93,0:01:58.22,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Hongou is on a roll today.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.47,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,His splitters are too sharp!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:08.61,0:02:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick your pitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:11.61,0:02:14.61,Default,int_Shirakawa,0,0,0,,You're there representing Tokyo. Start playing like it!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.83,0:02:21.70,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.12,0:02:24.12,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Yes, our first hit!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.63,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,That's our captain!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:26.71,0:02:28.63,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,We won't let it end this way.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.25,0:02:33.22,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,Our ace is pitching just as well as you.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:35.93,0:02:37.47,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,You can do it, Shirasu!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:37.47,0:02:38.64,Default,@Nakada,0,0,0,,You're on target!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:38.64,0:02:39.43,Default,@Higasa,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.09,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,We're just getting started!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.09,0:03:13.63,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Hold them off and go again in the next inning!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.97,0:03:14.97,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.32,0:05:03.66,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,This is our inning!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.66,0:05:04.78,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:04.78,0:05:06.58,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Get us another run!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.33,Default,@Nakada,0,0,0,,Keep it going, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.33,Default,@Seki,0,0,0,,Focus on the first batter!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.64,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,He has a sharp swing.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.52,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,Make sure to keep it low.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.62,0:05:53.96,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,No more runs.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.58,0:05:55.50,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,Bring it.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.17,0:05:59.21,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,Not a single one.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.22,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,You won't even reach base!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.18,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,Bring it, punk!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.66,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Those two are crazy!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.04,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,They're on fire!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.58,0:06:38.04,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,I don't want this game to end!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.77,0:07:00.77,Default,Todoroki,0,0,0,,Whoa! I wanna hit that!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.23,0:07:02.74,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,What kind of game is this?!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.74,0:07:03.94,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,They're too good!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.16,Default,Nitta,0,0,0,,Looking at this, it's hard to tell who's winning the game.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.46,Default,Nitta,0,0,0,,That pitcher's good.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.96,0:07:20.79,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,Nice pitch, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.42,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Nice pitching!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:26.09,0:07:27.30,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,Masamune.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.47,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,You're the relief pitcher tomorrow.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.47,0:07:32.14,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,Start warming up in the bullpen during the first inning.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:32.14,0:07:34.60,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,Getting all worked up about \Nfacing the bottom of the order.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.68,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:38.77,0:07:41.19,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,390)}Your prospects look grim.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.20,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.99,0:07:49.70,Default,Enjo,0,0,0,,Masamune, let's go!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.63,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Two innings left.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.72,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,How will they knock him out of the game?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.44,0:08:26.74,Default,@int_Kanemaru,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:28.82,0:08:33.08,Default,@int_Kanemaru,0,0,0,,We have to do something to support Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.23,Default,Seto,0,0,0,,A pinch hitter.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.15,Default,Okumura,0,0,0,,He can launch one into the stands.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.28,Default,Okumura,0,0,0,,They're hoping he can give them a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.28,0:09:15.12,Default,Okumura,0,0,0,,They just haven't been able to get a run.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.45,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.12,0:09:23.96,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.10,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.11,0:09:50.40,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,We're not done yet!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.74,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Hit, Asou!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.74,0:09:52.74,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,You're just warming up!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.33,0:10:07.84,Default,@int_Aso,0,0,0,,I'm not going to go down easy!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.24,0:10:40.58,Default,_Reporter,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.08,Default,_Reporter,0,0,0,,Is he going into an even higher gear?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.09,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Nice pitch, Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.09,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,You're doing great!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.09,0:10:52.46,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Nice pitching, Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.09,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:03.81,0:11:07.56,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,Only one inning left to score.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:10.19,0:11:12.44,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,If we don't catch up in the ninth,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.28,0:11:15.32,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,there won't be any more pitching.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.24,0:11:21.95,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,I want to stand on that mound right now!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:22.87,0:11:23.95,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, for sure...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.87,0:11:28.00,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,I want to help the team with my pitching!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.59,0:11:35.34,Default,@Kataoka,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.72,Default,@Furuya,0,0,0,,Please let me pitch.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.53,Default,Carlos,0,0,0,,There he is again.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.16,0:12:03.62,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,I guess they can't swap him out.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.16,0:12:05.62,Default,Shirakawa,0,0,0,,They have no reason to swap him out.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.13,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.13,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,You're just as good as him!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.13,0:12:18.05,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,We still have the ninth inning.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.10,Default,@int_Tojo,0,0,0,,Furuya is pitching so well.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.72,0:12:25.56,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,We won't let this end yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.93,0:12:28.14,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Number 9's up next!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.14,0:12:29.44,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Start with the first batter!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.44,0:12:31.40,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Make sure to get him out, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.40,0:12:34.15,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Everyone in the field, help him out!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.28,0:12:37.65,Default,@int_Maezono,0,0,0,,Yeah, we know!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:37.65,0:12:38.82,Default,@int_Shirasu,0,0,0,,We've got this.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.91,0:12:41.16,Default,@int_Kanemaru,0,0,0,,That guy...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.16,0:12:50.87,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,This is it, guys!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.87,0:12:54.42,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,We're in the lead, but we've been routed the whole second half of the game!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.42,0:12:58.76,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Let's get another run and put them down for good!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.76,0:12:59.93,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.93,0:13:02.43,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Let's go, Sasaki! Sock it to ‘em!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.43,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,He's thrown over 120 pitches,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.89,0:13:12.94,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,but Furuya keeps improving in response to Hongou.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.16,0:13:28.95,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,Furuya,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.12,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,just how far...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.42,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,will you go?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.52,0:13:51.89,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.89,0:13:54.48,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,His fastest pitch of the day, 154 km/h!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.44,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,That's what I like to see!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.44,0:13:56.77,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:01.32,0:14:02.53,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.28,0:14:07.70,Default,Seto,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.17,0:14:15.00,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.81,0:14:32.64,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,So you've got some good breaking balls too!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.77,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Did you see how far it broke?!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.77,0:14:34.98,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Was that a slider?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.98,0:14:36.81,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,How many strikeouts was that?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.81,0:14:38.07,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Eleven!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.66,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,He's looking better than ever!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.87,0:14:49.79,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Nice pitch, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.60,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Strike three!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.02,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,You're out!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.24,0:15:29.45,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,That's twelve!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.95,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.95,0:15:32.54,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,He really is a monster!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.54,0:15:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.54,0:15:35.25,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,He's going toe-to-toe with Hongou!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.12,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,I bet you could throw 160 km/h!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.12,0:15:38.92,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.91,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.78,0:16:12.53,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,You don't see games this good every day.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.29,Default,int_Shoji,0,0,0,,I want to hit.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.29,0:16:17.12,Default,int_Shoji,0,0,0,,I want to play.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.79,Default,Seto,0,0,0,,That was unbelievable, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.48,0:17:27.03,Default,@fbint_Kominato,0,0,0,,We won't let this end yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.61,0:17:29.95,Default,@fbint_Kominato,0,0,0,,I'll make sure...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.36,0:17:33.82,Default,@fbint_Kominato,0,0,0,,Miyuki gets a chance to bat.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.25,0:17:45.38,Default,Owada,0,0,0,,Both Hongou and Furuya pitched complete games,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.59,Default,Owada,0,0,0,,and the only runs were the two in the first inning.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.46,0:17:52.26,Default,Owada,0,0,0,,Seidou only had the one hit from Miyuki,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.26,0:17:56.56,Default,Owada,0,0,0,,but Komadai Fujimaki was also outmatched by Furuya in the second half of the game.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.56,0:18:00.60,Default,Owada,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for those two runs, \Nthe outcome may've been different.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.39,0:18:04.73,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,Both teams used pitcher relays to get to the quarters,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.73,0:18:07.32,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,and then let their ace play the whole game.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.53,0:18:11.15,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,That was the quality of the pitching in this game.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.32,0:18:14.32,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,You got us good.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.41,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,We couldn't even touch the ball in the last inning.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.78,0:18:19.04,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,But our ace isn't bad, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.04,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,He's way better than not bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.04,0:18:23.04,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,He just needs to improve his attitude.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.50,0:18:24.71,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.05,0:18:32.34,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Don't go losing to anyone else until we meet again.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.92,0:18:35.55,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we'll kick your butts next time too.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.10,Default,Enjo,0,0,0,,Hey, Masamune.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:38.10,0:18:39.56,Default,Enjo,0,0,0,,He's trying to shake hands.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.56,0:18:41.43,Default,Enjo,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.31,0:18:47.90,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,You beat us!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.90,0:18:48.94,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.94,0:18:50.07,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.07,0:18:51.53,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,Hey, Sawamura!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.95,0:18:59.28,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.28,0:19:01.12,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,That was some great pitching!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:01.12,0:19:02.62,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Make sure you come back again!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.21,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Koushien Stadium will be waiting!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.21,0:19:06.21,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:09.25,0:19:13.09,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,They let you take some of the dirt home, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.09,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.76,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,But not many people do it in the spring.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.76,0:19:21.26,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,There's still the summer.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.26,0:19:23.93,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,If you took it now, it's like you wouldn't be coming back.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.39,0:19:27.40,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Still want some?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.48,0:19:33.07,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,Eijun...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.36,0:19:36.57,Default,@Kawakami,0,0,0,,Sawamura?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.92,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,I need to do something.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.59,0:19:57.13,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.13,0:19:59.26,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,If you're gonna take some, take it from near the dugout!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.97,0:20:08.85,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,There was no room for me in that game.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.40,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.19,0:20:16.15,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,So much for "tomorrow."
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.78,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,No matter how much you reflect,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.78,0:20:24.41,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,no matter how much you prepare,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.04,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,if you don't perform when you need to,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.21,0:20:31.33,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,you won't get any chances.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.68,0:20:47.77,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,All you can do is watch from here.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.15,0:20:55.86,Default,@Tojo,0,0,0,,Dirt from the bullpen?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.87,0:21:06.83,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,I won't forget how much this hurt...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.50,0:21:14.46,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,because I want to stand on that mound again!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.43,0:21:31.60,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,Facing the towering wall before him
Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.27,0:21:35.36,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,and seeing and experiencing his situation
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.36,0:21:38.28,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,all served to strengthen his resolve.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.28,0:21:44.57,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,He clasped a handful of dirt on this, the day it began.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:49.87,0:21:52.04,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Give the stadium your respect!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.04,0:21:53.79,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.73,0:22:17.07,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,"The Day It Began."
Dialogue: 5,0:22:18.98,0:22:18.98,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:48.99,0:23:48.99,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.53,0:23:54.45,Default,Takashima,0,0,0,,Those who shone at Koushien Stadium and those who didn't both want to return.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:54.79,0:23:57.29,Default,Takashima,0,0,0,,I think they feel it strongly.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:57.29,0:24:01.63,Default,Takashima,0,0,0,,What changes will the new first-years bring?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:01.63,0:24:02.92,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.92,0:24:04.17,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,We need to do it before he comes!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:05.13,0:24:06.84,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,I've waited so long for this day!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:06.84,0:24:12.06,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,I wonder what new challenges these guys will bring.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:12.06,0:24:14.56,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Next time on Ace of the Diamond act II:
Dialogue: 5,0:24:14.93,0:24:16.18,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,"Joining."
Dialogue: 5,0:24:16.18,0:24:18.39,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Let's win the national title!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.69,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's the ninth day of the spring invitational!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.69,0:08:21.69,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}There are two innings left in the fourth quarterfinal game.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:21.69,0:08:24.32,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Will Seidou High School be able to catch up?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.42,0:08:44.84,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He pops it up!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.47,0:08:50.84,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The second baseman Nishi makes the catch for one out.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.60,0:09:01.35,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Replacing the eighth batter, Yamaguchi, is Maezono.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.73,0:09:04.31,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now batting, Maezono.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.45,0:09:21.46,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Will the pinch hitter, Maezono, be able to get his team going?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:40.52,0:09:43.10,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}It goes straight to the left fielder!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.61,0:09:48.44,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The pinch hitter flies out to left field, and Seidou now has two outs!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:53.45,0:09:55.57,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The nine-hole, Asou, is up to bat.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.99,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can he set things up for the top of the order?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.90,0:10:29.44,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He goes down swinging!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.74,0:10:35.57,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Komadai's ace, Hongou, has been pitching stupendously!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.57,0:10:38.78,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's only allowed one hit this entire game!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.08,0:10:47.71,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Once again, Hongou gives Seidou High School a zero on the scoreboard!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.93,0:10:59.35,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seidou High School is unable to\N mount a comeback against Hongou!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.27,0:11:50.56,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're nearing the end of the quarterfinal between Seidou and Komadai Fujimaki.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:52.19,0:11:53.98,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}After giving up two runs,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.36,0:11:59.70,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seidou will be looking to hold Komadai scoreless as they head into the ninth starting at the top of their order.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.62,0:12:10.21,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Taking the mound in the bottom of the \Neighth to great fanfare is Furuya Satoru!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.97,0:14:25.76,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Strike three!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.14,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The last pitch was a slider!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.23,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Another strikeout!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.01,0:00:35.93,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}And that's strike three!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:35.93,0:00:40.39,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He takes down Seidou's top three batters in an incredible start!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.39,0:00:43.19,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He has yet to allow a run at Koushien Stadium!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.98,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}A strong hit between shortstop and third!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.95,0:00:56.87,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}After giving up two runs in the first, \NSeidou's ace Furuya Satoru has been showing real tenacity.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.81,0:02:02.48,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now it's time for the cleanup hitter Miyuki's third at-bat!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.24,0:02:19.83,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Miyuki connects!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.93,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can they make use of this opportunity?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.03,0:02:53.32,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}It fell off the table!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.32,0:02:55.15,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He goes down swinging!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.74,0:03:01.16,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Komadai's Hongou again leaves Seidou scoreless!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.39,0:04:52.02,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's the fourth game of the spring invitational quarterfinals.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.02,0:04:54.02,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The score has remained 0-2 since the first inning.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.53,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}In the bottom of the seventh,\N Komadai Fujimaki is now up to bat.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.96,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Up at bat is their ace, Hongou Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.49,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Swing and a miss on an outside pitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.53,0:06:25.16,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}And it's caught!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.16,0:06:27.03,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Right to the left fielder!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.37,0:06:31.54,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}This round of the ace battle goes to Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.81,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Two in a row!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.81,0:06:57.10,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's his tenth strikeout!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.40,0:07:09.45,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}With his form improving,\N he's had perfect fifth, sixth, and seventh innings!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:58.17,0:08:04.67,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Batting first in the top of the eighth for Seidou High School is the third baseman, Kanemaru.
